        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bad witch is hungry for children again. So she makes an ingenious plan to lure the kids with a magnificent cake. But unfortunately, she doesn't have any ingredients at home. Since Lara Croft is busy with the new remake, the Master Chief is on a Hawaii vacation in, and Link has to rescue Zelda again, only you remain. So, with a sparrow on your head, you set out to collect the eight sacred ingredients from the children's realm. Not easy when you're made of sugar and cookies...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868950/extras/3fe5e6cc5c4b4b22559a16a6002643e8.poster.avif?t=1763135737\" width=600 height=85 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868950/extras/3fe5e6cc5c4b4b22559a16a6002643e8.webm?t=1763135737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;<strong><i>The Witch's fabulous Cracker Show</i></strong>&quot;. Slip into the role of Cracker and travel with a mysterious elevator to various places in search of the ingredients. On your journey, you'll meet strange members of the Dead Animal Club, an annoying radish man, treacherous baked goods, and capricious witches. Solve little puzzles and fight against the six hungry child generals who will try to eat you. But hey, you'll make it, because the friendly Weapons Guru always provides you with the right tools. The game is musically accompanied by classical music and modern swing beats. Visit places like the Pretzel Festival, Irina's Vegetable Garden, and Distel's Dollhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Dive into an imaginative adventure full of explosive vegetables, dancing fishbones, and plenty of humor. If we can make you smile, we've achieved our goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy &quot;The Witch's fabulous Cracker Show&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This awaits you: <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868950/extras/2e0d4fcbfd44fd28be94a3c59d121ffc.poster.avif?t=1763135737\" width=32 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868950/extras/2e0d4fcbfd44fd28be94a3c59d121ffc.webm?t=1763135737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game with 2 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three learnable skills from the Weapons Guru (Cinnamon Star, Christmas Cracker, Caramel Cannon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Candy Shop for equipment and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classical music by Tchaikovsky, Bach, Bizet, and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various children as final bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character collection with all the crazy characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous Easter eggs related to series, games, and movies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two animated videos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 10 puzzles and lots of hidden bonus content</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bad witch is hungry for children again. So she makes an ingenious plan to lure the kids with a magnificent cake. But unfortunately, she doesn't have any ingredients at home. Since Lara Croft is busy with the new remake, the Master Chief is on a Hawaii vacation in, and Link has to rescue Zelda again, only you remain. So, with a sparrow on your head, you set out to collect the eight sacred ingredients from the children's realm. Not easy when you're made of sugar and cookies...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868950/extras/3fe5e6cc5c4b4b22559a16a6002643e8.poster.avif?t=1763135737\" width=600 height=85 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868950/extras/3fe5e6cc5c4b4b22559a16a6002643e8.webm?t=1763135737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;<strong><i>The Witch's fabulous Cracker Show</i></strong>&quot;. Slip into the role of Cracker and travel with a mysterious elevator to various places in search of the ingredients. On your journey, you'll meet strange members of the Dead Animal Club, an annoying radish man, treacherous baked goods, and capricious witches. Solve little puzzles and fight against the six hungry child generals who will try to eat you. But hey, you'll make it, because the friendly Weapons Guru always provides you with the right tools. The game is musically accompanied by classical music and modern swing beats. Visit places like the Pretzel Festival, Irina's Vegetable Garden, and Distel's Dollhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Dive into an imaginative adventure full of explosive vegetables, dancing fishbones, and plenty of humor. If we can make you smile, we've achieved our goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy &quot;The Witch's fabulous Cracker Show&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This awaits you: <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868950/extras/2e0d4fcbfd44fd28be94a3c59d121ffc.poster.avif?t=1763135737\" width=32 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868950/extras/2e0d4fcbfd44fd28be94a3c59d121ffc.webm?t=1763135737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game with 2 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three learnable skills from the Weapons Guru (Cinnamon Star, Christmas Cracker, Caramel Cannon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Candy Shop for equipment and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classical music by Tchaikovsky, Bach, Bizet, and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various children as final bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character collection with all the crazy characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous Easter eggs related to series, games, and movies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two animated videos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 10 puzzles and lots of hidden bonus content</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Play as Cracker, the witch's errand boy. Collect ingredients for the ingenious cake plan and avoid the hungry children. Solve amusing puzzles, unlock new abilities, and explore the witty world of the Cracker Show.",
